OL,3,GNEWSATeenager picked up knife to scare
OL,4,Agroup, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of fatally stabbing
OL,7,Fa 14-year-old boy during a fight
OL,8,Farranged on social media has told a
OL,9,Fcourt picked up a kitchen knife after
OL,10,Fseeing a large group gather outside his
OL,11,Fhome.
OL,13,FThe 15-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,14,Fbecause of his age, denies murdering
OL,15,FChristopher McBurnie in Ramsey on 29
OL,16,FMay last year.
