OL,3,GNEWSATeenager picked up knife to scare
OL,4,Agroup, trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence, he said he was
OL,7,F"scared" after looking out of his
OL,8,Fkitchen window and seeing what appeared
OL,9,Fto be "20 or 30 people" outside,
OL,10,Fprompting him to "grab a knife" from a
OL,11,Fblock.
OL,13,FHis defence says he acted in
OL,14,Fself-defence, but prosecutors argue he
OL,15,Fmurdered Christopher.
